<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mentenanță</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .loader {
            border: 5px solid #f3f3f3;
            border-top: 5px solid #3498db;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }
        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Ne pare rău!</h1>
        <p>Site-ul este în mentenanță. Revenim cât mai curând posibil.</p>
        <div class="loader"></div>
    </div>
    <footer>
        Colegiul National "Grigore Moisil"<br>
        Bd. Timisoara 33, Sector 6, Bucuresti
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
